      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pauloni jaarole kora sonaani ilaale waan jed'e, Oboleyaani, anini qalbi tiyya keesati imbeekha, aka anini, wollaala male, Waaqa dura deeme haga arrale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaallichi Guddaani, ka Anania jed'ani, worra isa bira ejaanjuuni, Afaani keesa d'aa jed'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.23.27+MAT.23.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 23.27-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Pauloni waan isaani jed'e, Waaqumaani si d'ainna, atini aka naabo d'akhaani jaraani ta daara dibani adeesani jirta; aka sila Seera gula na qortuufi arma teete ammo Seera male afaani keesa d'aa namaani jetta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Paulo bira ejaanjatu waan jed'eeni, Atini Qaallicha Waaqa Gudda arabsita! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.22.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bah 22.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Pauloni waan jed'eeni, Oboleyaani tiyya, anini aka inni Qaallicha Gudda imbeekhu. T'aafiini waan jettu, Worra isani fidu waan hamtu injed'inaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
