            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Huji 26.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Fil 3.5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pauloni aka jari gari Sadukayo ammalle ka gari Farisayo arginaani, kora keesati qonqo olfud'ate waan jed'e, Oboleyaani, anini Farisayo, ammalle ilma Farisayooti. Wonti na qoraniifi maro anini kaisa nama due abdad'uufi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni akana jennaani, jiddu Farisayootiifi ta Sadukayo moramaani d'ufte gumiini gargari qoodamte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 22.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.12.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 12.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.20.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 20.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Sadukayoni, Kaisi nama due injiru jetti; ammalle malaikafi ekheraani injirtu jetti, ammo Farisayooni, wonti kuni sadeenu injirti jetti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guddo iyani, jari Seera beekhu ka gama Farisayo kae morme waan jed'e, Daba nama kana irati ingarre, hegeri d'uguma ekheraani yokhaani malaikaani isaani dubbatte jed'ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moromaani aka taka inargiini d'umnaani guddaani askarti waan worri Paulo qabe gargari tarsaasu sehe. Tanaafi askarti iti erge, aka isiini gadi buute harka isaani keesa irreeni isa fuute mana ufiti isa galchitu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halkani lameeso Aabbooni isa bira ejate waan jed'e, Garaa jabaad'u, akuma Yerusalemu keesati na d'ugeesite suni, Rumile keesati na d'ugeesu malte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Paulo ijeesani mariatani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti bariinaani jari Yahudi toko wold'aqe, kakhu jabdu toko wolti kakhatani waan jed'ani, Haga Paulo ijeemnuti nyaane ind'unnu jed'ani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri kakhate sunini nama afurtama ira jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gara qaalole gugurdofi jaarole d'aqani waan jed'ani, Nu ya kakhu jabdu kakhanne, aka woma inyaanne haga Paulo ijeemnuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi isani, jaarole kora woliini, gudda askartiti hima, aka inni Paulo fuula keesa duraani d'ufu, aka waan dubbi ira mid'aafachu feetani. Ammo ato inni armaani imbaane, nu kurfo jirra, aka isa ijeemnu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo ilmi oboleeti Paulo dubbi tana d'ageennaani mana askarti olseene Pauloti hime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pauloni askarticha toko yaame waan jed'eeni, Kaima kana gara gudda askarti geesi. Inni woi iti himu fed'a jed'eeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Askartichi isa fuud'e, gara gudda askarti isa geese waan jed'eeni, Pauloni, namichi hid'aansa keesa jiru kaani, na yaame, Kaima kana gara gudda kanketi geesi naani jed'e; inni dubbi jabdu ta siini jed'u qaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guddaani askarti harka qabe, fulla nami injirre isa geese. Maani nati himu feeta? jed'e gaafate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni waan jed'eeni, Yahudiini ya wold'ate ammalle si kad'achu feeti, aka atini bori Paulo gara kora geesitu, aka isiini waan kora keesati dubbi isaa d'agayu feetu ufi tolchitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo dubbi worra inch'aqasiini, nama haga afurtamati isa eegu jira. Worri ch'ufti ya kakhate, aka nyaatani ind'unne haga isa ijeesaniti. Kurfo jirani aka waan suni tolchani, ammo qonqo tante eegachu jirani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guddaani askarti, Aka atini waan kana nati himte nama tokoleti inhimini, kaima kaaniini jed'e, ufi biraa deemsise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paulo gara Kaisaria geesani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
